              "evidence"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "output_port": {
        "port_id": "out",
        "produces_kind": "mini.criticism.v1"
      },
      "instruction": "Do not propose. You are shown both the documented rules and the source. Read this cycle's executions beside the proposals: for each expectation that failed, say whether the proposer misread the rule, or the rule as written and the code part company; quote the rule's words and name the line of code. Say which failures matter and what a proposer should try next. Cite blocks by id."
    },
    {
      "kind_id": "mini.verdict.v1",
      "title": "Verdict",
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "port_id": "executions",
          "port_type": "pair_executions",
          "window": "this_cycle"
        },
